      "content": "i mean i already took a benadryl like 2 hours ago and nothing is happening. its not like i'm dying or anything, just itchy and a bit weird in my throat. i really dont want to sit in an urgent care waiting room for 4 hours if i can just double up on the antihistamine? is that safe to do if it's just allergies?",
